- A (Attack): Fire projectile. Cooldown: 3s.
- I (Inventory): Open modal.

No "first press does nothing" bugs. No delays beyond cooldowns.

• 8. Joystick Integration

Joystick controls lateral movement (left/right) of the astronaut.
- Joystick input read continuously (not just on press).
- Movement speed: base 100 pixels per second.
- Joystick and buttons do NOT conflict. Pressing a button does not interrupt joystick movement.

• 9. Error Handling

If any V4 component fails to load (buttons missing, joystick invisible, black bars stuck):
- Log error to console.
- Attempt to reinitialize UI after 1 second.

Graceful degradation:
- If joystick fails, buttons still work.
- If buttons fail, joystick still works.
- Do not crash.

